{"id":"17335df21f7731bf","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-vertex-cover.md","title":"VERTEX-COVER","display":"df-vertex-cover — VERTEX-COVER","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-vertex-cover — VERTEX-COVER","label":"28-df-vertex-cover","aliases":["28-df-vertex-cover"],"type":"definition","depends_on":["[[28-df-finite-graph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vertex-cover — VERTEX-COVER"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-vertex-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-vertex-cover</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\">\\(G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\)</span> (有限简单无向图, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq V\">\\(S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (顶点子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsVertexCover}_G(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsVertexCover}_G(S)\\)</span> (顶点覆盖谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a> 给出的图与自然数阈值编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{VC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{VC}}\\)</span> 由下式固定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> (VERTEX-COVER 语言)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\qquad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\ k\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\qquad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\ k\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsVertexCover}_G(S)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq V\\land\\forall\\{u,v\\}\\in E\\;(u\\in S\\lor v\\in S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsVertexCover}_G(S)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq V\\land\\forall\\{u,v\\}\\in E\\;(u\\in S\\lor v\\in S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(G,k)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land k\\in\\mathbb{N}\\land\\exists S\\subseteq V\\;(|S|\\leq k\\land\\mathrm{IsVertexCover}_G(S))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{VERTEXCOVER}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(G,k)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land k\\in\\mathbb{N}\\land\\exists S\\subseteq V\\;(|S|\\leq k\\land\\mathrm{IsVertexCover}_G(S))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源核对：习题2.15；印刷65页；PDF91页。至多阈值及覆盖所有边已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2}