oloring]]、[[28-df-set-cover]]。"},{"id":"b5b8f3d84579602d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsVertexCover}_G$、$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{VC}}$ 见 [[28-df-vertex-cover]]。"}],"outgoing":["dada5c223e508373"]}